    "Put on Bob Marley's Jammin'. Take a small puff each time you hear the word." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Put on Bob Marley's Jammin'. Take a small puff each time you hear the word."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Zet Jammin' van Bob Marley op. Neem een klein hijsje elke keer dat je het woord hoort."
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState" : "manual"
    },
    "Put on Daft Punk's One More Time and go round the circle. Each time the song says \"one more time\", the next player takes a puff and holds it. You breathe out once the player after you has taken theirs. Keep the puffs small; anyone who needs to breathe out just does." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Put on Daft Punk's One More Time and go round the circle. Each time the song says \"one more time\", the next player takes a puff and holds it. You breathe out once the player after you has taken theirs. Keep the puffs small; anyone who needs to breathe out just does."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Zet One More Time van Daft Punk op en ga de kring rond. Elke keer dat het nummer \"one more time\" zegt, neemt de volgende speler een hijs en houdt die vast. Je blaast uit zodra de speler na jou zijn hijs heeft genomen. Houd de hijsjes klein; wie moet uitblazen, doet dat gewoon."
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState" : "manual"
    },
